      en: ["The Société Africaine de Raffinage (SAR) was established in 1961.", "The refinery officially commenced its industrial operations in 1963.", "Historically processed approximately 1.2 million tons of crude oil per year.", "A current modernization project aims to increase annual capacity to 1.5 million tons.", "The state-owned Petrosen holding company maintains a roughly 46% stake.", "Primary supplier of liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) for domestic use in Senegal.", "Crucial for integrating domestic crude oil production from the Sangomar field."],
